### ============================================
### Testes Diretos no Bridge MCP (Opcional)
### ============================================

### (Opcional) Chamar list_products diretamente no bridge MCP (sem filtros)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mcp/tools/call
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "list_products",
  "arguments": {}
}

### (Opcional) Chamar list_products diretamente no bridge MCP (com filtros)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mcp/tools/call
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "list_products",
  "arguments": {
    "category": "Eletrônicos",
    "subcategory": "Smartphones"
  }
}

### (Opcional) Chamar list_products com filtro por preço
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mcp/tools/call
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "list_products",
  "arguments": {
    "minPrice": 500,
    "maxPrice": 1000
  }
}

### (Opcional) Chamar list_products com busca por texto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mcp/tools/call
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "list_products",
  "arguments": {
    "search": "notebook"
  }
}

### (Opcional) Chamar get_product_by_code diretamente no bridge MCP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mcp/tools/call
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "get_product_by_code",
  "arguments": {
    "code": "PROD-001"
  }
}

### (Opcional) Chamar get_product_by_code - PROD-002
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mcp/tools/call
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "get_product_by_code",
  "arguments": {
    "code": "PROD-002"
  }
}


